<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia IOI Corp year net up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia IOI Corp year net up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 18.90   vs	  18.20</p>
<p>    Net profit		 149.60   vs	 119.90</p>
<p>    Turnover		   675.43   vs	 649.25</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   261.14   vs	 213.51</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 38.57   vs  less  35.95</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   55.64   vs	  28.71</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 3.0    vs	   3.0</p>
<p>NOTE - IOI Corp Bhd is involved in plantations activities, making industrial and medical gases and property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
